@page "/api"

<PageTitle>API Guide — ExLlamaSharp</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <h1>API guide</h1>
    <p>OpenAI-compatible <code>/v1</code> and admin <code>/api/v1</code>. Authenticate with <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;api-key&gt;</code> (admin scope required for <code>/api/v1</code>).</p>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">OpenAI-compatible (<code>/v1</code>)</h5>
        <table class="table-clean">
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/chat/completions</code></td><td>Chat; supports <code>stream</code>, tools, multimodal content</td></tr>
                <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/completions</code></td><td>Text completions</td></tr>
                <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/embeddings</code></td><td>Embeddings</td></tr>
                <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/tokenize</code></td><td>Tokenize text</td></tr>
                <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/v1/detokenize</code></td><td>Detokenize ids</td></tr>
                <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/models</code></td><td>List models</td></tr>
                <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/models/{id}</code></td><td>Model details</td></tr>
                <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/v1/metrics</code></td><td>JSON engine metrics</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Admin (<code>/api/v1</code>)</h5>
        <table class="table-clean">
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Area</th><th>Endpoints</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Settings</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST/PATCH /settings</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Models</td>
                    <td>
                        <code>GET /models/library</code>, <code>GET /models/library/search</code>,
                        <code>POST /models/load|unload|pull|quantize|import|alias</code>,
                        <code>GET/PUT /models/{id}/modelfile</code>,
                        <code>GET /models/jobs/{job_id}</code>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Jobs</td>
                    <td><code>GET /jobs</code>, <code>POST /jobs/{id}/cancel</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Keys</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /keys</code>, <code>DELETE /keys/{id}</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Users</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /users</code>, <code>PATCH/DELETE /users/{id}</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Moderation</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /moderation/rules</code>, <code>DELETE /moderation/rules/{id}</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Backup</td>
                    <td><code>POST /backup</code>, <code>POST /backup/restore</code>, <code>POST /restart</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>A/B</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /ab</code>, <code>GET /ab/{id}</code>, <code>POST /ab/vote</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Tenants</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /tenants</code>, <code>GET /tenants/{id}</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Adapters</td>
                    <td><code>GET/POST /adapters</code>, <code>GET/DELETE /adapters/{id}</code></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Other</td>
                    <td><code>GET /about</code>, <code>GET /logs/stream</code> (SSE)</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Ops (no API key)</h5>
        <ul class="mb-0">
            <li><code>GET /health</code> — liveness</li>
            <li><code>GET /ready</code> — readiness (model / engine)</li>
            <li><code>GET /metrics</code> — Prometheus text</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="form-text mt-3 mb-0">Live dashboard metrics: SignalR hub <code>/hubs/dashboard</code> (method <code>metrics</code>).</p>
    </div>
</div>
